<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CARL"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GUY"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Cosmos openeing sequence</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> Carl’s Kooky Concoctions</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Carl’s.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A taste bud odyssey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> A Taste Bud Odyssey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>By me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> By Carl </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sagan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Carl </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sagan</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Finish sequence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Sagan</Text>
      <Text> standing on the ship of the imagination.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In the quest to create a cherry pie from scratch, we first, of course, had to invent a universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well, we did.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The Pie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Delicious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We have our very own.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>One of unspeakable beauty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Her mysteries softly call out to us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Like a long forgotten childhood song.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Follow me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl jumps into the small galaxy next to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s not so dissimilar to your own. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The universe you are familiar with.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The universe you call home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl lands in a city park.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In my universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>People are more open to reason.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl stares angrily into the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CARL (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The only deity recognized here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Bacchus</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The god of wine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And revelry!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>In this universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Imagination rules.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My imagination.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And I.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Am the truth giver.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">plainswalker</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Wandering philosopher.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My personal favorite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Prank Master.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. City Park - DAy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl walks up to Matt eating a hotdog. Carl taps Matt on the shoulder and points to the heavens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt points to the hotdog.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl shakes his head, gesticulates the immensity of the universe by pulling his hands apart like with taffy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Then points back to the heavens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt looks up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl tries to pants Matt, but Matt looks back in anger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt shouts at Carl.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl takes it in stride then returns with both barrels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>As Carl yells, he grabs the hotdog and gesticulates with it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Then Carl bites the hotdog to close his point.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He puts the hotdog back in Matt’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt looks down at his food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt is sad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl feels bad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl does the “buck up, kid” arm motion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl remembers!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Science!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">TITLECARD:</Text>
      <Text> Science!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl reaches into his blazer and produces a telescope!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He extends it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Thumbs up to the sky.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt appears nonplussed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl looks to the heavens with his telescope, then nods to Matt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt agrees and takes the telescope and looks to the heavens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl looks on as the truth giver, with paternal love.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl pants Matt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl runs off as Matt shimmies a step or two then does the “you got me” look and returns his gaze skyward with the telescope.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl shimmies off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CARL"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. City Park - DAy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl wanders on a path as a jogger approaches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl stops the jogger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>She jogs in place.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl gesticulates.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The jogger slowly stops jogging as Carl speaks to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl ends his speech by miming a huge explosion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The jogger starts crying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl laughs to himself and saunters towards the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Carl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I revealed the scope her role in the universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Carl walks straight off camera, the weeping jogger in the background.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

